    <script type="application/ld+json"> {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "NewsArticle",
    "headline": "Demokrat Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019dan \u201cB\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz mu Malazgirt mi\u201d tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131na tepki",
    "name": "Demokrat Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019dan \u201cB\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz mu Malazgirt mi\u201d tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131na tepki",
    "inLanguage": "tr-TR",
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://www.canses.net/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-dan-buyuk-taarruz-mu-malazgirt-mi-tartismalarina-tepki/134934"
    },
    "publisher": {
        "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
        "name": "Canses",
        "logo": {
            "@type": "ImageObject",
            "url": "https://www.canses.net/images/generals/logo.png",
            "width": 240,
            "height": 60
        }
    },
    "datePublished": "2021-08-28T15:19:08+03:00",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-24T21:46:10+03:00",
    "description": "\u201c\u0130n\u015fallah Cumhuriyetimizin 100. Y\u0131l\u0131nda milletimiz AKP dahil t\u00fcm felaketlerden kurtulacakt\u0131r!\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cAnlamalar\u0131 gerekiyor ki T\u00fcrk Milleti\u2019nin tarihi y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00fc i\u00e7inde kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131 zaferler de bedelini \u00f6dedi\u011fi ma\u011flubiyetler de bizimdir\u201d",
    "articleBody": "(DP Bas\u0131n Merkezi \u2013 28 A\u011fustos 2021) Demokrat Parti Genel\r\nBa\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal, kamuoyunda \u201cB\u00fcy\u00fck\r\nTaarruz mu Malazgirt mi\u201d alg\u0131s\u0131 yarat\u0131lmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131larak tart\u0131\u015fmalara yol\r\na\u00e7an AKP zihniyetine sert ele\u015ftirilerde bulundu.\u00a0Yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 yaz\u0131l\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada AKP\u2019nin B\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz ve Dumlup\u0131nar\r\nZaferi\u2019ni g\u00f6rmezden gelerek Malazgirt Zaferi\u2019ni \u00f6n plana \u00e7\u0131karmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131na\r\ndikkat \u00e7eken Genel Ba\u015fkan Uysal, \u201cOysa\r\nanlamalar\u0131 gerekiyor ki T\u00fcrk Milleti\u2019nin tarihi y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00fc i\u00e7inde kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131\r\nzaferler de bedelini \u00f6dedi\u011fi ma\u011flubiyetler de bizimdir\u201d dedi. \u00a0AKP\u2019nin yanl\u0131\u015fta yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade eden Uysal, \u201cEn k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede memleketi bu AKP\r\nfelaketinden kurtaraca\u011f\u0131z! \u0130n\u015fallah Cumhuriyetimizin 100. Y\u0131l\u0131nda milletimiz\r\nAKP dahil t\u00fcm felaketlerden kurtulacakt\u0131r!\u201d diye konu\u015ftu.\u00a0Demokrat Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131 \u015f\u00f6yle:\u00a0\u201cT\u00fcrkiye Cumhuriyeti\u2019nin k\u0131ymetini en\r\n\u00e7ok AKP iktidar\u0131 bilmelidir!\u201d\u00a0\u201c\u0130slam co\u011frafyas\u0131ndaki Suriye, Irak ve son\r\nolarak Afganistan \u00fclkelerinin aynas\u0131nda kendimize baksak TC Devletini y\u0131kmak\r\nisteyenlere dahi Cumhuriyet\u2019in bizlere sundu\u011fu hukuk, huzur, g\u00fcvenlik, refah ve\r\nf\u0131rsat e\u015fitli\u011finin anlam\u0131n\u0131, k\u0131ymetini anlar\u0131z!\u00a0T\u00fcrkiye Cumhuriyeti\u2019nin k\u0131ymetini; ge\u00e7mi\u015fini yok varsayarak\r\nAtat\u00fcrk ba\u015fta olmak \u00fczere kurucu kadro ve de\u011ferlerini \u00f6rseleyen ancak \u00f6te\r\ntaraftan ise bu cumhuriyetin her t\u00fcr imkan ve imtiyaz\u0131ndan azami derecede\r\nyararlanan AKP iktidar\u0131 bilmelidir!\u00a0\u201cB\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz ve Dumlup\u0131nar Zaferi\u2019ni\r\ng\u00f6rmezden gelerek Malazgirt\u2019i \u00f6n plana \u00e7\u0131karmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorlar\u201d\u00a0AKP hala yanl\u0131\u015fta yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor! Sakarya Sava\u015f\u0131 ve Kocatepe\u2019den\r\nba\u015flayan B\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz ve Dumlup\u0131nar Zaferi\u2019ni g\u00f6rmezden gelerek Malazgirt\u2019i \u00f6n\r\nplana \u00e7\u0131karmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Oysa bilmiyorlar ki Malazgirt Zaferi de bizim,\r\nSakarya ve Dumlup\u0131nar Zaferi de bizim!\u00a0Birbiri ile zaferleri yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak, k\u0131yas yapmak yerine,\r\nanlamalar\u0131 gereken ger\u00e7ek \u015fudur; T\u00fcrk Milletimize Anadolu\u2019nun kap\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7an\r\nMalazgirt Zaferi\u2019dir. Ayn\u0131 zamanda bilmeliler ki Anadolu\u2019da kalma, ya\u015fama\r\nirademizin tescili olan B\u00fcy\u00fck Taarruz ile Kocatepe\u2019den ba\u015flayan, Kurtulu\u015f\r\nSava\u015f\u0131\u2019d\u0131r!\u00a0\u201cKazand\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z zaferler de bedelini\r\n\u00f6dedi\u011fimiz ma\u011flubiyetler de bizimdir\u201d\u00a0\u00a0AKP zihniyeti tarihe \u015fark kurnazl\u0131\u011f\u0131yla, \u2018alakart men\u00fc\u2019 olarak\r\nbak\u0131yor. Be\u011fendi\u011fini al\u0131yorlar, be\u011fenmedi\u011fini alm\u0131yorlar. Oysa anlamalar\u0131\r\ngerekiyor ki T\u00fcrk Milleti\u2019nin tarihi y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00fc i\u00e7inde kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131 zaferler de\r\nbedelini \u00f6dedi\u011fi ma\u011flubiyetler de bizimdir.\u00a0\u201cMemleketi bu AKP felaketinden\r\nkurtaraca\u011f\u0131z!\u201d\u00a0Velhas\u0131l hi\u00e7bir millet ve devlet AKP\u2019nin T\u00fcrkiye\u2019ye ya\u015fatt\u0131\u011f\u0131\r\ntravmaya benzer s\u00fcre\u00e7lerle \u00e7ok uzun gidememi\u015ftir! En k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede memleketi bu\r\nAKP felaketinden kurtaraca\u011f\u0131z! \u0130n\u015fallah Cumhuriyetimizin 100. Y\u0131l\u0131nda\r\nmilletimiz AKP dahil t\u00fcm felaketlerden kurtulacakt\u0131r!\u201d\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00a0",
    "wordCount": 331,
